-- ฟังก์ชันฝนดาวตกแบบตกถี่ + ระเบิดบล็อกฉาก (Local Visual - ไม่ได้คิลใน Server)
local function triggerLocalMeteorShower()
	if isMeteorRunning then return end
	isMeteorRunning = true

	BannerLabel.Visible = true
	task.delay(3.5, function()
		if BannerLabel then
			BannerLabel.Visible = false
		end
	end)

	local endTime = os.clock() + 10
	task.spawn(function()
		while os.clock() < endTime do
			for i = 1, 3 do
				local char = LocalPlayer.Character
				local root = char and char:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart")
				if root then
					local offsetX = math.random(-95, 95)
					local offsetZ = math.random(-95, 95)
					local targetPos = root.Position + Vector3.new(offsetX, 0, offsetZ)
					local spawnPos = targetPos + Vector3.new(math.random(-25, 25), 110, math.random(-25, 25))

					local meteor = Instance.new("Part")
					meteor.Shape = Enum.PartType.Ball
					meteor.Size = Vector3.new(4, 4, 4)
					meteor.Material = Enum.Material.Neon
					meteor.Color = Color3.fromRGB(255, 95, 15)
					meteor.Position = spawnPos
					meteor.Anchored = false
					meteor.CanCollide = false
					meteor.Parent = workspace

					local bodyVel = Instance.new("BodyVelocity")
					bodyVel.MaxForce = Vector3.new(1e5, 1e5, 1e5)
					bodyVel.Velocity = (targetPos - spawnPos).Unit * 110
					bodyVel.Parent = meteor

					Debris:AddItem(meteor, 2.5)

					task.delay(0.85, function()
						if meteor and meteor.Parent then
							local impactPos = meteor.Position
							local exp = Instance.new("Explosion")
							exp.Position = impactPos
							exp.BlastRadius = 18
							exp.BlastPressure = 500000
							exp.DestroyJointRadiusPercent = 1
							exp.Parent = workspace

							local regionParts = workspace:GetPartBoundsInRadius(impactPos, 18)
							for _, part in ipairs(regionParts) do
								if part:IsA("BasePart") and not part.Locked and part.Size.Magnitude < 60 then
									if not (LocalPlayer.Character and part:IsDescendantOf(LocalPlayer.Character)) then
										part.Anchored = false
										part:BreakJoints()
									end
								end
							end

							meteor:Destroy()
						end
					end)
				end
			end
			task.wait(0.15)
		end
		isMeteorRunning = false
	end)
end

